{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10132340","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10132340","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1013234001:0":{"text":"역시나. 반신 앞에서 인간은 비밀이 있을 수가 없군요...","source_cn":"果然。人在半神面前，没有秘密……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF0A613A47D474567","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1013234002:0":{"text":"갑자기 나타났다가 갑자기 사라졌어요! 다시 블루문 스톤을 던져서 소환해 볼까요?","source_cn":"像突然出现一样，突然消失了！要不要再投入月光石召唤试试？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F01A1E245B6915B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1013234003:0":{"text":"그 방법은 하지 않는 것을 추천할게. 눈치 없이 계속 남아서 게으름 부리는 반신님 방해하지 말고, 이제 떠납시다.","source_cn":"我可不建议那样。还是走吧，别不识趣地留在这里打扰半神大...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBCABF1912CCDB030","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1013234004:0":{"text":"음... 반신님도 게으름을 부리나요?","source_cn":"唔……半神大人也会偷懒吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4E7C12F1A7CF885","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:特弥希娅":{"text":"테미히아","source":"特弥希娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:菲":{"text":"페이","source":"菲","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:维伦":{"text":"발렌","source":"维伦","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"s